  "sourceTitle": "Mango and Avocado Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Mango and Avocado Salsa\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 12:01am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 peeled and finely diced mango\n1/2 finely diced small red onion\n1 chopped avocado\n2 tablespoons chopped fresh cilantro\n1/4 cup Herb Dressing\n\nPreparation\n\n1 COMBINE mango with onion, avocado, cilantro and dressing in a small bowl. 2 LET STAND for 4 hours or overnight to mellow flavours.\n\nAbout\n\n\nTIP: To prevent the avocado from browning cover with plastic wrap placing directly onto the salsa.",
